            "zh-Hant": "要寄幾件",
            "zh-Hans": "要寄几件",
            "en": "How many bags"
          },
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "response": {
        "ja": "15日です",
        "audio": "luggage-delivery.date.response.mp3",
        "voice": "Orus"
      },
      "explanation": {
        "zh-Hant": "「何日」是幾號，「ご搭乗日」是搭機那天。說日期加「です」，例如「15日です」。寄到機場要提早幾天寄出，截止時間依業者不同，請先確認，以現場說明為準。",
        "zh-Hans": "「何日」是几号，「ご搭乗日」是登机那天。说日期加「です」，例如「15日です」。寄到机场要提早几天寄出，截止时间依快递公司不同，请先确认，以现场说明为准。",
        "en": "何日 asks which date and ご搭乗日 is the day you fly. Say the date with です, like 15日です. Bags must go out some days before your flight, and the cut-off differs by company, so check early and follow what the staff tell you."
      },
      "wordIds": [],
      "reviewNote": "Cut-off for airport delivery (how many days before the flight) differs by courier and airport; the explanation deliberately gives no number. Confirm the wording."
